  {
   "id": "el-paso-elsewhere-151788@4",
   "gameId": "el-paso-elsewhere-151788",
   "displayName": "Patch 4",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-09-28T22:49:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi again!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're pushing a new patch for the game with a few more fixes and tweaks. We've skipped version 3 and headed straight to v4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "V4 CHANGELOG",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some interactables in Game_21Castle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked the priority of some audio sources including Chapter 2's Horny Hostage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked some NPCs in Game_13Motel_Ourobouros.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where boss battles could break after dying mid-battle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Toilet moans are louder now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked 3Motel_Shotgun to prevent the player from getting stuck.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prevented backtracking in Game_6Motel_SeatOfPower.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Game_17Castle tweaks (a bit more ammo and tweaks to a specific encounter!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can no longer get stuck in the meat ramp in Game_32MeatLocker.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can no longer trick enemies into getting locked behind Game_32MeatLocker's... sphincter...door.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a couple of issues with Molotovs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Puppets should be a bit easier to hit now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Strikebreaker has been nerfed: deals a biiiit less damage now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Puppetmaster should now actually do something in Game_7Motel_Aperture.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I never thought I'd write the words \"sphincter\" and \"toilet moans\" in a patch note but here we are.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's also worth mentioning that we've added a Bug Reporting section to our Discussion Board! We'll keep an eye out for any nasty issues posted in there.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, thank you for playing El Paso, Elsewhere! Now grab your stakes and get to work.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
